# Ignore list for the ROOT stow package (`stow .`).
#
# Providing this file REPLACES stow's built-in default ignore list, so the
# defaults are repeated here verbatim before the additions at the bottom.

# --- stow defaults -----------------------------------------------------
RCS
.+,v

CVS
\.\#.+
\.cvsignore

\.svn
_darcs
\.hg

\.git
\.gitignore
\.gitmodules

.+~
\#.*\#

^/README.*
^/LICENSE.*
^/COPYING

# --- additions ---------------------------------------------------------
# Platform-specific stow packages, stowed by name instead of via `stow .`
# (see setup.sh). Without these they would be linked as ~/omarchy etc.
^/omarchy$
^/omarchy-vm$

# Helper scripts that belong in the repo, not in $HOME.
^/tools$
